1
00:00:01,184 --> 00:00:02,779
Thanks, everyone.

2
00:00:02,779 --> 00:00:09,618
I -- I...I spend... what I would call an inordinate amount of time on the Internet, doing really stupid things.

3
00:00:09,618 --> 00:00:17,597
Doing things that I'm n-- like replying to e-mails that are not necessarily meant for me.

4
00:00:17,597 --> 00:00:22,288
I -- I have, uh -- I have veitch@domain.com for my e-mail address.

5
00:00:22,288 --> 00:00:25,892
And what that means is that, if someone misses off the initial, I get the e-mail.

6
00:00:25,892 --> 00:00:29,284
So, I get a lot of e-mails for Veitchs who, I have no idea who they are.

7
00:00:29,284 --> 00:00:31,774
I got an e-mail that was addressed to Alan and Deb Veitch.

8
00:00:31,774 --> 00:00:34,154
I have literally no idea who these people are.

9
00:00:34,154 --> 00:00:36,540
But it said "Please review the cash estimate."

10
00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:38,892
And it was from a -- It was a company -- It was a swimming-pool company.

11
00:00:38,892 --> 00:00:51,386
A guy called, basically, Lex... runs a company called Relex Pools.

12
00:00:51,386 --> 00:00:54,483
And the pool was 102 LF, right?

13
00:00:54,483 --> 00:00:56,821
And I thought -- I thought I'd test the water, so to speak...

14
00:00:56,821 --> 00:01:02,123
...and I said, "Look, what does LF, uh -- What does LF stand for?"

15
00:01:02,123 --> 00:01:06,271
And... they got back in touch.

16
00:01:06,271 --> 00:01:09,338
And they said, "LF stands for 'linear feet.'"

17
00:01:09,338 --> 00:01:20,399
Janice... did not seem to mind or notice the fact that I was neither Alan nor Deb.&nbsp;

18
00:01:20,399 --> 00:01:23,073
I thought, "That's interesting."

19
00:01:23,073 --> 00:01:24,802
She said, "See attached plans."

20
00:01:24,802 --> 00:01:26,691
Now, she attached these plans of the proposed swimming pool.

21
00:01:26,691 --> 00:01:31,062
So, basically, you guys, you've got, here -- You've got the, uh...

22
00:01:31,062 --> 00:01:41,803
We've got the neighboring houses, some foliage, and up at the top left we've got this -- Alan and Deb's house.

23
00:01:41,803 --> 00:01:45,451
And then, that's the proposed pool.

24
00:01:45,451 --> 00:01:51,843
And I want to be very clear about this, guys -- you should never reply to an e-mail that's not meant for you.

25
00:01:51,843 --> 00:01:53,588
You shouldn't do it.

26
00:01:53,588 --> 00:01:53,281
Why?

27
00:01:53,281 --> 00:01:58,617
Because you should just delete the e-mail, let the people know they've made a terrible mistake.

28
00:01:58,617 --> 00:02:19,057
However... looking at that... I don't know about you, but to me... I just didn't think Alan and Deb were gonna be happy with that.

29
00:02:19,057 --> 00:02:26,221
I said "Janice, I'm gonna be frank..."

30
00:02:26,221 --> 00:02:34,369
"...I'm unhappy with the size of the pool." "

31
00:02:34,369 --> 00:02:37,322
"Mr. Veitch, it's not legal to build on private property."&nbsp;

32
00:02:37,322 --> 00:02:43,390
"The pool is as large as it can be without encroaching on your neighbor's property." "

33
00:02:43,390 --> 00:02:47,640
I said, "Old Man McPhearson?"

34
00:02:47,640 --> 00:02:50,639
"He won't mind." "

35
00:02:50,639 --> 00:02:54,560
I said, "We're still skimping on the size of the pool.

36
00:02:54,560 --> 00:03:07,102
I don't want people to come around and be like, 'Where's the pool?'" "

37
00:03:07,102 --> 00:03:15,775
"Balls on the line, Janice."&nbsp;

38
00:03:15,775 --> 00:03:18,270
"It needs to be larger." "

39
00:03:18,270 --> 00:03:21,870
She said, "How much larger?"

40
00:03:21,870 --> 00:03:34,518
I said, "Boom."

41
00:03:34,518 --> 00:03:37,333
"That is not possible." "

42
00:03:37,333 --> 00:03:41,079
No [bleep], Janice.

43
00:03:41,079 --> 00:03:44,598
"We cannot build that close to the property." "

44
00:03:44,598 --> 00:03:53,622
"Well, if the property is a problem, I'll take out the property." "

45
00:03:53,622 --> 00:04:03,979
I'll be honest -- I thought, based upon that, that she would know that I was joking.

46
00:04:03,979 --> 00:04:12,927
"Where will you live?" "

47
00:04:12,927 --> 00:04:25,462
I said, "Boom."

48
00:04:25,462 --> 00:04:27,962
James Veitch. Look out for his comedy special later this year. James Veitch。

